--- [3] 组装与启动 ---
tar xzf /data/zhike-s5test-pack.tar.gz -C /data/zhike-s5test
mv frontend/dist dist && mkdir -p media staticfiles app-h5 data
grep DJANGO_SECRET_KEY /data/zhike-v2/deploy/.env.production >> .env.s5test   # 密钥继承旧部署，不落仓库
docker compose -f docker-compose.s5test.yml -p zhike_s5test up -d
→ zhike_s5test_mysql Healthy / backend Started / frontend Started
entrypoint：等 MySQL 就绪 → migrate 全部应用（含 labs.0006、ai.0017/0018 生成列）→ collectstatic 163 → gunicorn 4×12

